<h1>Lesson 3: Coding Basics</h1>
<div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #E4E2F8; color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Aligns to curriculum Lessons 4-7</div>
<p>This lesson introduces foundational coding concepts using Code.org's Python Lab and Neighborhood IDE, or programming platform.</p>

<p>You will explore key programming elements such as variables, print statements, objects, and functions.</p>
<div style="clear: both;"></div>
<p>This lesson prepares you to teach four curriculum lessons:</p>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<p><b>Curriculum Lesson 4:</b> Variables and Data Flow</p>
<a href="[LESSON 4 URL]" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 4</a>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<p><b>Curriculum Lesson 5:</b> Working with Objects</p>
<a href="[LESSON 5 URL]" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 5</a>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
<p><b>Curriculum Lesson 6:</b> Functions</p>
<a href="[LESSON 6 URL]" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 6</a>
</div>
<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
<p><b>Curriculum Lesson 7:</b> Functions with Parameters</p>
<a href="[LESSON 7 URL]" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 7</a>
</div>
<hr>
<p><b>By the end of this lesson, you'll:</b></p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Navigate the IDE and understand its essential features for coding instruction</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;">• Identify and apply key coding concepts, including variables, print statements, objects, and functions</p>
<p style="margin: 0;">• Use a Predict, Investigate/Modify, Practice (PRIMM) approach to engage students in coding exploration and skill development</p>
<p style="margin: 16px 0 0 0;"><i>Suggested time: 25 minutes</i></p>
<hr>
